EXEC model.apply_capability_from_dsl @document = N'{"contractId":"capability-from-dsl-change.v1","source":"capability answer-api-response\nintent: The frontdoor''s declared answer for a request it does not dispatch: it returns the api-response.v1 it is given, so refusals take the same path as answers.\noutcome: the api-response.v1 it was given\ninquiry: What does the frontdoor answer for this request?\ninput contract answer-api-response-request.v1 {\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":true,\"required\":[\"contractId\",\"status\"],\"properties\":{\"contractId\":{\"const\":\"api-response.v1\"},\"status\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}}}\noutput contract answer-api-response-result.v1 {\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":true,\"required\":[\"contractId\",\"status\"],\"properties\":{\"contractId\":{\"const\":\"api-response.v1\"},\"status\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}}}\ncli display outcome as json\nscenario answer-api-response root terminal\ngiven: an api-response.v1\nwhen: the kernel evaluates the declared SEJ\nthen: the outcome is that api-response.v1\noperation answer-api-response.evaluate kind invoke-port port answer-api-response-evaluate\nplatform bind answer-api-response-evaluate\nplatform: sda-authority-transformation-port.v1\nconfig: {\"transformationAuthorityRef\":\"semantic-transformation.authority.json\",\"transformationId\":\"answer-api-response\"}","isMcpTooling":false}';
EXEC model.apply_capability_from_dsl @document = N'{"contractId":"capability-from-dsl-change.v1","source":"capability serve-api-request\nintent: The declared API frontdoor: read sidefx-api-interface.v1 with the request, resolve the declared operation, admit the caller and bind its input in SEJ, run the operation''s capability, and compose the api-response.v1. A refusal is answered as declared, through answer-api-response.\noutcome: the api-response.v1 of the request: status, headers and body\ninquiry: What does the frontdoor answer for this request?\ninput contract serve-api-request-request.v1 {\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"required\":[\"request\"],\"properties\":{\"request\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"caller\":{\"type\":[\"object\",\"null\"]}}}\noutput contract serve-api-request-result.v1 {\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":true,\"required\":[\"contractId\",\"status\"],\"properties\":{\"contractId\":{\"const\":\"api-response.v1\"},\"status\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}}}\ncli display outcome as json\nscenario serve-api-request root terminal\ngiven: an HTTP request and its caller\nwhen: the kernel reads the interface, resolves in SEJ and runs the operation''s capability\nthen: the outcome is the declared api-response.v1\noperation serve-api-request.prepare kind invoke-port port serve-api-request-prepare\noperation serve-api-request.interface kind invoke-port port serve-api-request-interface\noperation serve-api-request.resolve kind invoke-port port serve-api-request-resolve\noperation serve-api-request.dispatch kind invoke-port port serve-api-request-dispatch\noperation serve-api-request.respond kind invoke-port port serve-api-request-respond\nplatform bind serve-api-request-prepare\nplatform: sda-authority-transformation-port.v1\nconfig: {\"transformationAuthorityRef\":\"semantic-transformation.authority.json\",\"transformationId\":\"serve-prepare-interface-read\"}\nplatform bind serve-api-request-interface\nplatform: generic-capability-invocation.v1\nconfig: {\"providerId\":\"sql-database-reader\",\"authoritySource\":\"DATABASE\",\"capabilityIdPath\":\"executionTarget\",\"namespacePath\":\"executionNamespace\",\"scenarioPath\":\"executionScenario\",\"requestPath\":\"dispatchRequest\",\"resultPath\":\"result\",\"lineageMode\":\"retain-nested-execution\"}\nplatform bind serve-api-request-resolve\nplatform: sda-authority-transformation-port.v1\nconfig: {\"transformationAuthorityRef\":\"semantic-transformation.authority.json\",\"transformationId\":\"serve-resolve-request\"}\nplatform bind serve-api-request-dispatch\nplatform: generic-capability-invocation.v1\nconfig: {\"providerId\":\"generic-capability-invocation\",\"authoritySource\":\"DATABASE\",\"capabilityIdPath\":\"executionTarget\",\"namespacePath\":\"executionNamespace\",\"scenarioPath\":\"executionScenario\",\"requestPath\":\"dispatchRequest\",\"resultPath\":\"result\",\"lineageMode\":\"retain-nested-execution\"}\nplatform bind serve-api-request-respond\nplatform: sda-authority-transformation-port.v1\nconfig: {\"transformationAuthorityRef\":\"semantic-transformation.authority.json\",\"transformationId\":\"serve-compose-response\"}","isMcpTooling":false}';

